## RelationType: 隶属于

下级科室隶属于上级科室，可逐级向上追溯；一级科室没有上级。

### Endpoint

| Source | Target | Type |
|--------|--------|------|
| department | department | direct |

### Mapping Rules

| Source Property | Target Property |
|-----------------|-----------------|
| parent_dept_id | dept_id |

